'la-mission-haut-brion|la-clarte-de-haut-brion-blanc|2021':{note:'The mildness of winter 2021 causes budburst to start early on 1st March. In spring, the month of April is marked by a severe incidence of frost in the Bordeaux region. The position of Haut-Brion’s vineyard once again shows its inestimable value, as the frost spared the large majority of the plots. Heavy rain during the months of May and June has little impact on the vines. In keeping with spring, the beginning of summer is wet and quite cool, so the vine develops slowly. 2021 is a winegrower’s vintage, one in which the vineyard requires a lot of attention.',blend:{SEM:56,SB:44},alc:13.5,src:'Fiche-technique_Clarte_2021_EN-1.pdf',months:'31',oak:5},
